{
  "mod": {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 2190,
      "hub_id": 2893,
      "guid": "com.pein.camerarecoilmod",
      "name": "Recoil Rework (Legacy)",
      "slug": "recoil-rework-legacy",
      "teaser": "Or.. tweaks? Doesn't matter. Vanilla recoil sucks anyway.",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2893.png",
      "downloads": 32380,
      "favourites_count": 10,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Mod Info</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3>Introduction</h3>\n<p>Tarkov’s recoil feels kind of bland and weightless. This (relatively) lightweight mod aims to make recoil punchier by tweaking some recoil values. While I am open to suggestions, this mod is ultimately shaped by my own preferences and is thus highly opinionated around what I would like Tarkov’s recoil to look and feel like. Feature requests are always welcome.</p>\n<p>I encourage you to play around with various settings to see what suits you.</p>\n<h3>Preview</h3>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"81Rk5ZNKia8\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/81Rk5ZNKia8?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/81Rk5ZNKia8/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n<p>Somewhat outdated and not the best example of what’s possible with this mod. I’ll get around to making a better preview someday.</p>\n<h3>Installation</h3>\n<p>Drag and drop. Like any other mod.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/wByb5Ln.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wByb5Ln.gif\" alt=\"wByb5Ln.gif\" /></a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Recommended Mods</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3>A small list of mods I would recommend using alongside Recoil Rework:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/942-fontaine-s-fov-fix/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Fontaine’s FOV Fix</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2176-better-rear-sights/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Better Rear Sights</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1753-reflex-sights-rework-updated/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Reflex Sights Rework  </a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2683-hollywoodfx/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">HollywoodFX  </a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2949-eye-relief-tweak/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Eye Relief Tweak</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>… and a few others, but I’m gatekeeping them.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Realism</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3>Realism &amp; Recoil Rework</h3>\n<p>This mod is largely incompatible with Realism Mod’s recoil changes and causes weapons to go flying all over the screen when fired due to how Recoil Rework works. Because of this I would recommend not using this mod alongside Realism. Besides that Realism’s gunplay is great as is (thx fontaine)</p>\n<p>However, if you REALLY want to use this mod with Realism then make sure to either <strong>edit the Recoil Rework config</strong> or <strong>disable Realism’s recoil changes</strong> within its server config. Good luck!</p></div></div></div>\n",
